(drone-poi-loiter)
*title Source-driven vertical launch, POI loiter, and return-home mission
*atmos none
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0

*trajectory 1 drone start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=6378137 y=0 z=0 xdt=0 ydt=0 zdt=0 time=0 mass=25
  *file drone.dat time xecfc yecfc zecfc vel relrng[2] relrng[3] relrng[4] relrng[5]
  *segment 1 cold-launch
    *integ dtprnt=1 dt=0.1
    *prop thrust=400 mdot=0
    *fly gamgd=90
    *when time>5 goto 2
  *segment 2 poi-1-loiter
    *integ dtprnt=1 dt=0.1
    *fly propnav=2
    *when time>15 goto 3
  *segment 3 poi-2-loiter
    *integ dtprnt=1 dt=0.1
    *fly propnav=3
    *when time>25 goto 4
  *segment 4 poi-3-loiter
    *integ dtprnt=1 dt=0.1
    *fly propnav=4
    *when time>35 goto 5
  *segment 5 return-home
    *integ dtprnt=1 dt=0.1
    *fly propnav=5
    *when relrng[5]<25 stop
    *when time>80 stop

*trajectory 2 poi-1 start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=6377937 y=0 z=0 xdt=80 ydt=0 zdt=0 time=0 mass=1
  *file poi-1.dat time xecfc yecfc zecfc
  *segment 1 moving-poi-track
    *integ dtprnt=1 dt=0.1
    *when time>80 stop

*trajectory 3 poi-2 start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=6377937 y=10 z=0 xdt=80 ydt=0 zdt=0 time=0 mass=1
  *file poi-2.dat time xecfc yecfc zecfc
  *segment 1 moving-poi-track
    *integ dtprnt=1 dt=0.1
    *when time>80 stop

*trajectory 4 poi-3 start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=6377937 y=20 z=0 xdt=80 ydt=0 zdt=0 time=0 mass=1
  *file poi-3.dat time xecfc yecfc zecfc
  *segment 1 moving-poi-track
    *integ dtprnt=1 dt=0.1
    *when time>80 stop
  
*trajectory 5 home start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=6377937 y=0 z=0 xdt=80 ydt=0 zdt=0 time=0 mass=1
  *file home.dat time xecfc yecfc zecfc
  *segment 1 moving-home
    *integ dtprnt=1 dt=0.1
    *when time>80 stop
*end
